{"version":1,"content":"<p>知名媒體人秦朔近日發文稱，中國互聯網從微信時間，到字節跳動的「抖音加紅果時間」，呼籲字節為社會價值多做擔當。</p><p>抖音集團副總裁李亮昨日（27日）反駁，指定性極不嚴謹。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:21:17.919769+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:55:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:38:12.913430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T06:18:17.524760+00:00","content_hash":"101ca7168b69331e1f504e224b8f52d05719d92fb438be24e73d3b5ca8f22401","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}